# Recorded build products. A line-by-line merge of two independent
# recordings is not a build product -- it is a file no --record ever
# produced. Force a conflict so the golden gets re-recorded instead.
#
# Measured 2026-08-03, twice: rebasing two branches that had each
# re-recorded auto-merged both .sha files silently and reported success.
# Control: with this rule the same merge conflicts; without it, the
# result contains both edits and no gate notices.
scripts/core-golden/** -merge
